# KMBHelp

- Read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/sicherheit.md` before editing auth, mail, tickets, or public pages.
- Implement only the open phase in `docs/status.md`.
- TypeScript strict. Validate inputs with Zod from `packages/shared`.
- Business rules live in `apps/api`, not in React or Expo screens.
- Public ticket views must not include the body, the requester, or comments. The working list may show the subject.
- Never commit `.env`, secrets, dumps, or real client data.
- Do not add services that `docs/stack-entscheidung.md` rejects.
- UI copy is German and English. No emoji icons. Works at 390px width.
- Audit rows are append-only.
